226 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 100 0 R/E(POP MART\220s branding is successful and effective in communicating its youthful and premium collectable culture through its strong, consistent visuals and unique retail experience. POP MART uses bold, vibrant colours to attract attention and create a recognisable image, and maintains a visually dense environment across its physical stores, advertisements, packaging, and Social Media posts, fulfilling every customer touchpoint and creating excitement and encouraging exploration.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[1]>>
