227 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 100 0 R/E(POP MART\220s store layout resembles that of a \215treasure hunt\216 by carefully curating a customer experience through blind boxes and by using the element of surprise. Overall, POP MART\220s visual communication is consistent in portraying a trendy lifestyle brand and is effective in creating a fun and engaging experience for a Gen Z and young adult audience.)/Pg 19 0 R/K[2]>>
